name: sim.getCustomizationScriptAssociatedWithObject
description: 
luaSynopsis: int scriptHandle=sim.getCustomizationScriptAssociatedWithObject(int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the object that might have a customization script associated
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. handle of the customization script associated with the object, or -1 if the operation was not successful or the object doesn't have an associated script
